<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:wp81="using:Cornflower.Themes.Wp81">
  <!--
    Plain theme: Cornflower's design in the era's style, not a reproduction. Nothing in it is measured from the phone.
    ADR 0007 (docs/decisions/0007-plain-themes.md); docs/controls/CarouselPage/README.md.

    The phone had no CarouselPage. Here it is a FlipView of pages: Avalonia 12's CarouselPage drives a Carousel
    (PART_Carousel), which Wp81 already themes by type as the phone's FlipView (Controls/Carousel.axaml), so the pages
    swipe, snap and slide with the FlipView's own motion (PhoneFlipView, on CornflowerClock; none of this theme's own,
    rule 8). A header-less Pivot would need a Pivot as the part, which the CarouselPage doesn't drive.

    The CarouselPage hands the Carousel its own ItemsPanel, over the Carousel theme's, so its ItemsPanel here is the
    FlipView's PhoneFlipViewPanel, which PhoneFlipView moves; an app's own panel wins, and drops the FlipView's
    motion. IsGestureEnabled (on, Avalonia's) is the Carousel's IsSwipeEnabled. Under it, the page's background as
    Wp81's ContentPage (ApplicationPageBackgroundThemeBrush, PhoneForegroundBrush, PhoneFontFamilyNormal), round the
    FlipView's 2.5 inset.

      <CarouselPage>
        <ContentPage Header="one">...</ContentPage>
        <ContentPage Header="two">...</ContentPage>
      </CarouselPage>
  -->
  <ControlTheme x:Key="{x:Type CarouselPage}" TargetType="CarouselPage">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource ApplicationPageBackgroundThemeBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource PhoneForegroundBrush}" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{DynamicResource PhoneFontFamilyNormal}" />
    <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
      <ItemsPanelTemplate>
        <wp81:PhoneFlipViewPanel />
      </ItemsPanelTemplate>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <ControlTemplate>
        <Panel Background="{TemplateBinding Background}">
          <Carousel x:Name="PART_Carousel" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch" />
        </Panel>
      </ControlTemplate>
    </Setter>
  </ControlTheme>
</ResourceDictionary>
